# Data caches (regenerable; see Makefile / docs/data.md)
data/cache/*
!data/cache/.gitkeep

# Exception: the exact Dublin drive-network snapshot the demo_saving scenario
# was engineered against (see data/instances/README.md). OSM changes over time,
# and a fresh fetch shifts this delicately-balanced result away from its
# measured 7.4% saving; pinning this one cache file makes the demo
# bit-reproducible on any machine instead of chasing live map data.
!data/cache/dublin_drive_664cee449591eb29.pkl
!data/cache/dublin_drive_664cee449591eb29.pkl.sha256

# Results (per-run outputs; regenerable via `make experiment`)
results/*
!results/README.md

